    "summary": "No title",
    "description": "I found that when running Jsoup.clean() on a string that contains the format below, Jsoup throws: \nIllegalArgumentException: String must not be empty\n.\n\nThe problematic string format:\n\n'<a/*>'\n, (where * is a control char).\n\ni.e. \n<\nchar followed by a letter (a-z), then any chars, \n/\nand any control char (ASCII 0-31) except 0, 9-10, 12-13, any chars, and a \n>\nchar."
